00:13:18,480 --> 00:13:19,310
Here.

257
00:13:23,280 --> 00:13:24,960
Watch it! Let's go.

258
00:13:25,140 --> 00:13:26,434
We don't have all day.

259
00:13:28,080 --> 00:13:31,315
This is Pegasus One, requesting
permission for takeoff.

260
00:13:31,620 --> 00:13:32,717
Permission granted.

261
00:13:32,800 --> 00:13:34,117
You are clear for takeoff.

262
00:13:34,200 --> 00:13:35,030
Roger.

263
00:13:38,920 --> 00:13:39,840
All right.

264
00:13:40,260 --> 00:13:42,378
Let's see how fast this baby can go.

265
00:13:49,420 --> 00:13:51,596
Everything's going according to plan.

266
00:13:52,220 --> 00:13:54,573
You didn't think of everything, Bug Boy.

267
00:13:54,700 --> 00:13:57,300
I have to go to the bathroom really badly.

268
00:13:57,660 --> 00:13:58,637
Then hold it in.

269
00:13:58,720 --> 00:14:01,660
I told you to go before
we left, dino-brain!

270
00:14:03,580 --> 00:14:05,060
Your lunch is served.

271
00:14:05,420 --> 00:14:07,240
I'll take two. No, three.

272
00:14:07,460 --> 00:14:09,580
Why is it so freezing in here?

273
00:14:09,720 --> 00:14:14,544
I can't believe I let this guy talk me
into stopping myself into a smelly gym bag.

274
00:14:21,480 --> 00:14:25,497
The last thing I needed was ice
particles forming in my underwear.

275
00:14:25,580 --> 00:14:29,600
I'm sorry, but no amount of
rare cards is worth all of this.

276
00:14:35,820 --> 00:14:37,400
Well, this is it, guys.

277
00:14:48,120 --> 00:14:49,440
Pegasus, here we come.

278
00:14:49,700 --> 00:14:51,935
Looks like the easy part's over, Yugi.

279
00:14:52,340 --> 00:14:53,220
Step inside.

280
00:14:53,420 --> 00:14:54,497
We don't have a minute to spare.

281
00:14:54,580 --> 00:14:55,600
All right!

282
00:14:56,080 --> 00:14:58,080
The glitz and glamour continues!

283
00:14:58,480 --> 00:15:00,800
Hey, I never saw that bag before.

284
00:15:01,140 --> 00:15:03,117
Did any of you guys pack this one?

285
00:15:03,200 --> 00:15:04,480
Nope, it's not mine.

286
00:15:04,700 --> 00:15:05,677
Mine's the white one.

287
00:15:05,760 --> 00:15:06,590
Never saw it.

288
00:15:06,800 --> 00:15:09,397
We probably grabbed someone
else's bag by mistake.

289
00:15:09,480 --> 00:15:10,310
Is that right?

290
00:15:10,560 --> 00:15:13,137
Well, I'll just toss it
in the lost and found.

291
00:15:13,220 --> 00:15:15,217
No, we were so close, Weevil.

292
00:15:15,300 --> 00:15:16,560
I don't feel so good.

293
00:15:18,320 --> 00:15:19,680
It won't be long now.

294
00:15:23,620 --> 00:15:25,940
I said hold all my calls.

295
00:15:26,200 --> 00:15:29,397
And tell those reporters out
there once and for all that Kaiba

296
00:15:29,480 --> 00:15:33,097
Corp is not responsible in any
way for these monster sightings.

297
00:15:33,180 --> 00:15:34,010
End of story.

298
00:15:34,440 --> 00:15:36,317
And don't come back till they're gone.

299
00:15:36,400 --> 00:15:37,230
Yes, sir.

300
00:15:40,300 --> 00:15:43,241
I think someone's trying
to make a fool out of me.

301
00:15:43,640 --> 00:15:47,405
I have worked too hard repairing
the reputation of this company.

302
00:15:47,680 --> 00:15:48,780
This has to stop.

303
00:15:49,800 --> 00:15:52,506
Roland, I need an update
on our investigation.

304
00:15:52,620 --> 00:15:54,397
Do we have any leads whatsoever?

305
00:15:54,480 --> 00:15:55,480
Nothing yet, sir.

306
00:15:55,740 --> 00:15:57,757
I want answers, and I want them now.

307
00:15:57,840 --> 00:15:58,670
Yes, sir.

308
00:15:59,340 --> 00:16:01,811
The timing of this mess couldn't be worse.

309
00:16:01,980 --> 00:16:04,360
I'm about to announce my latest project.

310
00:16:05,180 --> 00:16:06,980
Seto, check out our database.

311
00:16:07,480 --> 00:16:11,077
There's someone out there that's
buying up every share of our company.

312
00:16:11,160 --> 00:16:11,990
Impossible.

313
00:16:12,560 --> 00:16:13,390
It's true.

314
00:16:13,580 --> 00:16:14,680
I saw it myself.

315
00:16:17,820 --> 00:16:19,720
Mokuba, you're right. Told ya.

316
00:16:20,240 --> 00:16:22,005
If these numbers are accurate,

317
00:16:22,200 --> 00:16:25,397
almost half of Kaiba Corp was
just bought by one person.

318
00:16:25,480 --> 00:16:26,857
And they're still buying.

319
00:16:26,940 --> 00:16:28,116
But how can that be?

320
00:16:28,700 --> 00:16:30,180
What are we gonna do?

321
00:16:30,640 --> 00:16:32,260
We have to stop them.

322
00:16:32,580 --> 00:16:36,992
If they buy any more shares, they could
take control of the entire company.

323
00:16:37,080 --> 00:16:39,397
And there's no way I'm gonna allow that.

324
00:16:39,480 --> 00:16:43,421
Wait, there's only one person who's
capable of something like this.

325
00:16:44,760 --> 00:16:45,590
Yes?

326
00:16:45,900 --> 00:16:47,880
Kaiba Boy, I've missed you.

327
00:16:48,960 --> 00:16:49,920
It was you.

328
00:16:50,080 --> 00:16:51,997
I'm afraid I'm guilty as charged.

329
00:16:52,080 --> 00:16:54,017
It looks like we're partners now.

330
00:16:54,100 --> 00:16:55,982
This is going to be so much fun.

331
00:16:56,240 --> 00:16:57,600
This company's mine.

332
00:16:57,860 --> 00:17:00,020
You're always so uptight, Kybervore.

333
00:17:00,240 --> 00:17:03,740
Why don't you treat yourself
to a nice vacation? Enough.

334
00:17:04,080 --> 00:17:07,877
I will never let a snake like you
wrap yourself around my company.

335
00:17:07,960 --> 00:17:08,790
Is that clear?

336
00:17:09,260 --> 00:17:10,090
Relax.

337
00:17:10,173 --> 00:17:11,349
I don't want your company.

338
00:17:11,720 --> 00:17:15,557
I just needed the upper hand so I
could force you to do something for me.

339
00:17:15,640 --> 00:17:17,581
Plus, I was bored and it was fun.

340
00:17:18,140 --> 00:17:22,877
You see, since both of our reputations are
at stake, thanks to these pesky monsters,

341
00:17:22,960 --> 00:17:26,097
I thought we could boost our
public image by doing each other.

342
00:17:26,180 --> 00:17:28,540
You must be out of your mind, Pegasus.

343
00:17:28,760 --> 00:17:30,580
Should I take that as a no?

344
00:17:30,860 --> 00:17:32,960
Well, I'd reconsider if I were you.

345
00:17:33,340 --> 00:17:34,520
Because if not,

346
00:17:34,800 --> 00:17:39,420
I'll buy the rest of Kyber Corp and
take it apart piece by pathetic piece.

347
00:17:39,620 --> 00:17:40,738
What's it gonna be?

348
00:17:41,040 --> 00:17:43,100
Do we have ourselves a rematch?

349
00:17:43,720 --> 00:17:46,240
Or should I just proceed with plan B?

350
00:17:46,940 --> 00:17:47,770
Hold on.

351
00:17:47,853 --> 00:17:49,347
I need an answer, Kaiba Boy.

352
00:17:50,200 --> 00:17:51,494
What are you gonna do?

353
00:17:53,080 --> 00:17:55,420
You have yourself a duel, Pegasus.

354
00:17:55,600 --> 00:17:57,517
I thought you'd see things my way,

355
00:17:57,600 --> 00:18:00,317
so I've set up an arena
for us in Duelist Kingdom,

356
00:18:00,400 --> 00:18:01,600
for old time's sake.

357
00:18:01,960 --> 00:18:04,960
Don't forget to bring your
blue-eyes white dragons.

358
00:18:06,420 --> 00:18:07,250
You okay?

359
00:18:14,020 --> 00:18:18,297
We were supposed to start building Kaivaland
amusement parks all over the world,

360
00:18:18,380 --> 00:18:21,556
and Seto promised he wouldn't
duel until we were done.

361
00:18:21,900 --> 00:18:25,488
He even locked all his cards
away, so he wouldn't be tempted.

362
00:18:28,800 --> 00:18:31,477
Are you sure you want
to go through with this?

363
00:18:31,560 --> 00:18:33,380
I have no choice, Mukuba.

364
00:18:40,480 --> 00:18:41,597
Access granted.

365
00:18:41,680 --> 00:18:43,327
Disengaging security system.

366
00:18:45,860 --> 00:18:48,360
Maybe Pegasus was just bluffing, you know?

367
00:18:48,920 --> 00:18:50,780
I can't take that chance.

368
00:18:51,020 --> 00:18:52,480
I have to do this.

369
00:18:58,240 --> 00:19:01,660
I knew someday I would unlock
my deck and duel again.

370
00:19:02,040 --> 00:19:04,569
I just never thought
it would be this soon.

371
00:19:19,100 --> 00:19:20,780
Let's go, Mokuba!

372
00:19:37,860 --> 00:19:38,700
What's wrong?

373
00:19:39,020 --> 00:19:40,017
It's just...

374
00:19:40,100 --> 00:19:43,100
I thought we were going to
get to build Kaiba Land.

375
00:19:43,320 --> 00:19:44,600
We will, Mokuba.

376
00:19:44,940 --> 00:19:47,420
Just as soon as I teach Pegasus a lesson.

377
00:19:50,160 --> 00:19:50,990
Awesome!
